 national row)\n   - `POPESTIMATE2025` for the 2025 population\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Get the total farmers markets excluding territories (sum the state data, excluding territories like PR, VI, GU, MP, AS)\n2. Get the 2025 population from the \"United States\" row\n3. Create a metric that calculates farmers markets per 100,000 residents\n\nLet me first explore the data to understand what states/territories are in the farmers markets data.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01JknKxNF39Nzrj6jqoQePgJ","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.select(\"state_name\", \"state_abbr\", \"farmers_markets\")","limit":100}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":14,"output":307,"cacheRead":15560,"cacheWrite":1462,"totalTokens":17343,"cost":{"input":0.000014,"output":0.0015350000000000001,"cacheRead":0.001556,"cacheWrite":0.0018275,"total":0.0049325},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":171},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912036247,"responseId":"msg_011Ce74G7pDAx6xwW4AeyQiP","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01JknKxNF39Nzrj6jqoQePgJ","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"state_name\",\"state_abbr\",\"farmers_markets\"\n\"California\",\"CA\",647\n\"New York\",\"NY\",555\n\"Pennsylvania\",\"PA\",426\n\"Minnesota\",\"MN\",390\n\"Illinois\",\"IL\",370\n\"Virginia\",\"VA\",336\n\"Wisconsin\",\"WI\",335\n\"Michigan\",\"MI\",321\n\"Massachusetts\",\"MA\",273\n\"Florida\",\"FL\",246\n\"Georgia\",\"GA\",231\n\"Ohio\",\"OH\",219\n\"Texas\",\"TX\",216\n\"Missouri\",\"MO\",208\n\"North Carolina\",\"NC\",196\n\"Iowa\",\"IA\",194\n\"Kentucky\",\"KY\",183\n\"Indiana\",\"IN\",181\n\"Colorado\",\"CO\",164\n\"Washington\",\"WA\",159\n\"Maryland\",\"MD\",140\n\"Connecticut\",\"CT\",124\n\"Kansas\",\"KS\",123\n\"Oregon\",\"OR\",122\n\"Alabama\",\"AL\",115\n\"Oklahoma\",\"OK\",102\n\"Arizona\",\"AZ\",97\